  "b287": "one time slot: $0A61, day wrap, food/rest down, +5 spirit energy",
  "b26f": "per-frame clock; frozen while $C8 is set",
  "00c8": "0 normal, 1 rested in room $0009, $FF in the other world",
  "00cb": "honeylamp fuel, one per room change; 0 destroys the lamp",
  "00cc": "an NPC or merchant offered class $09EF; TAKE spends it",
  "0f00": "bits 0-4 row, bit 5 carried, bit 6 exists, bit 7 room_hi",
  "0aa5": "$20, the carried bit; the $0AA0 table doubles as the joystick masks"
